as required.

1. cimplesid/v380-mac — "OpenV380"
   https://github.com/cimplesid/v380-mac
   Licence: MIT
   Copyright (c) OpenV380 contributors

   A clean-room Swift implementation of the V380 (Macrovideo) protocol. The cloud
   packet layouts for the SD-card index and playback commands (361/362/363/364),
   the relay keep-alive handling, the media-key derivation and the recorded-frame
   format implemented in this project are derived from that work.

2. PyanSofyan/V380Decoder
   https://github.com/PyanSofyan/V380Decoder
   Licence: see upstream repository

   Source of the relay dispatch endpoint (dispa1.av380.net) and its request
   signing scheme.

3. j-bloggs/v380-4g-stream
   https://github.com/j-bloggs/v380-4g-stream
   Licence: MIT

   Notes on relay login and AES handling for 4G camera units.

4. The various public V380Decoder ports that mapped the recorded-frame layout.

Field offsets in docs/PROTOCOL.md were additionally cross-checked byte for byte
against packet captures of the vendor Android app; those corrections (the
`ts == segment id` rule, the 0x3A/0x3E/0x42 field positions, the u16+5-byte clock
encoding) are original to this project.

The protocol remains the property of its authors. This project is not affiliated
with V380, V380 Pro, Macrovideo, or any camera manufacturer. "V380" is used only
to describe the devices this tool interoperates with.
